    Value: 1,212 KM
  - Label: ONE ORBIT
    Value: 6.39 DAYS
  - Label: DISTANCE FROM PLUTO
    Value: 19,591 KM
  - Label: SURFACE GRAVITY
    Value: 0.029 G
  - Label: DISCOVERED
    Value: 1978, JAMES CHRISTY
  description: Half Pluto's size, Charon is so large that the two orbit a point in the empty space between them, each keeping the same face to the other. A dark red cap covers its north pole.
